      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im panicking a bit my 4yo son has a really bad fever like 103.4 and hes acting super lethargic. i only have infant acetaminophen at home though... the little bottle says 160mg per 5ml. he weighs 38lbs. how much should i give him right now to get the fever down?? i dont want to take him to the er if i dont have to",
